%% Sensors -> local processing -> Observation events -> Context Compiler / World Model.
%% Perception never reasons, never calls a model for reasoning, never writes the World Model.
%% See ../PERCEPTION_MODEL.md.
flowchart LR
    MIC[Microphone] --> VAD[Local VAD] --> WW{Wake word?\n(fully local, low-latency)}
    WW -->|no| DROP[discard on host]
    WW -->|yes| WAKE[[wake.detected]] --> ASR[Local ASR\n(whisper.cpp / equivalent)]
    CAM[Camera] --> CV[Local CV\nhands / pose / presence / scene tags]
    SCRN[Screen / OS hooks] --> TELE[Screen / app / cursor telemetry\ndebounce + aggregate]
    ENV[Environmental sensors] --> THR[Threshold only]

    ASR --> OBS[[jarvis.perception.* Observation events\nclass: signal]]
    CV --> OBS
    TELE --> OBS
    THR --> OBS

    OBS --> NATS[(NATS JetStream — SIGNAL stream\n7-day rolling retention)]
    NATS --> CTX[Context Compiler\nmultimodal fusion: voice + gaze + cursor + app + presence]
    NATS --> WMI[World Model ingestion\npromote durable signals to facts]

    CV -. raw frames NEVER leave host (L27) .- CV
    MIC -. raw audio NEVER leaves host (L27) .- MIC
    OBS -. NATS down: bounded local ring buffer, drop-oldest, gap marker on reconnect .- OBS
